(1) 2509/       0 :                     ; HUD. The HUD components are linked in a chain, and linked to
(1) 2510/       0 :                     ; power-ups, because the mappings of monitors and lives counter(s)
(1) 2511/       0 :                     ; depend on one another. If you want to alter these (for example,
(1) 2512/       0 :                     ; because you need the VRAM for something else), you will probably
(1) 2513/       0 :                     ; have to edit the mappings (or move the power-ups and HUD as a
(1) 2514/       0 :                     ; single block unit).
(1) 2515/       0 : =$6E2                ArtTile_HUD_Score_E                   = ArtTile_ArtNem_HUD + $18
(1) 2516/       0 : =$6E4                ArtTile_HUD_Score                     = ArtTile_HUD_Score_E + 2
