   10127/    775E :                     ; Ring requirement values for Sonic and Tails games
   10128/    775E :                     ;
   10129/    775E :                     ; This array stores the number of rings you need to get to complete each round
   10130/    775E :                     ; of each special stage, while playing with both Sonic and Tails. 4 bytes per
   10131/    775E :                     ; stage, corresponding to the four possible parts of the level. Last part is unused.
   10132/    775E :                     ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
