   13895/    C1D8 :                     ; CHARACTER START LOCATION ARRAY
   13896/    C1D8 :                     
   13897/    C1D8 :                     ; 2 entries per act, corresponding to the X and Y locations that you want the player to
   13898/    C1D8 :                     ; appear at when the level starts.
   13899/    C1D8 :                     ; --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   13900/    C1D8 : (MACRO)              StartLocations: zoneOrderedTable 2,4	; WrdArr_StartLoc
