   15220/    CBCA :                     	; Rather than scroll each individual line of the background, this
   15221/    CBCA :                     	; zone scrolls entire blocks of lines (16 lines) at once. The scroll
   15222/    CBCA :                     	; value of each row is written to 'TempArray_LayerDef', before it is
