   17896/    DCDE :                     ; Scrap Brain Zone 1 block positioning array -- S1 left-over
   17897/    DCDE :                     ; Each entry is an index into BGCameraLookup; used to decide the camera to use
   17898/    DCDE :                     ; for given block for reloading BG. A entry of 0 means assume X = 0 for section,
   17899/    DCDE :                     ; but otherwise loads camera Y for selected camera.
   17900/    DCDE :                     ; Note that this list is 32 blocks long, which is enough to span the entire
   17901/    DCDE :                     ; two-chunk-tall background.
