(1)  550/    EB80 :                     
(1)  551/    EB80 :                     ; Computes how much the background layer has been scrolled in X and Y and
(1)  552/    EB80 :                     ; stores result to Camera_BG_X_pos_diff and Camera_BG_Y_pos_diff.
(1)  553/    EB80 :                     ; Caps maximum scroll speed to 16 pixels per frame in either direction.
(1)  554/    EB80 :                     ; This is used to decide how much of the BG needs to be reloaded.
(1)  555/    EB80 :                     ;
(1)  556/    EB80 :                     ; Used for rising lava/terrain in HTZ, and for WFZ->DEZ transition in WFZ.
(1)  557/    EB80 :                     ;
(1)  558/    EB80 :                     ; Input:
(1)  559/    EB80 :                     ;	d0	Target X position of background
(1)  560/    EB80 :                     ;	d1	Target Y position of background
