(1)    2/   108C4 :                     ; Object 1A - Collapsing platform from HPZ (and GHZ)
(1)    3/   108C4 :                     ; also supports OOZ, but never made use of
(1)    4/   108C4 :                     ;
(1)    5/   108C4 :                     ; Unlike Object 1F, this supports sloped platforms and subtype-dependant
(1)    6/   108C4 :                     ; mappings. Both are used by GHZ, the latter to allow different shading
(1)    7/   108C4 :                     ; on right-facing ledges.
