(1)   64/   10972 :                     	; This is too wide, causing the player to teleport downwards when
(1)   65/   10972 :                     	; running off the platform. Sonic 1 used a width of $30 for the
(1)   66/   10972 :                     	; collision and $64 for width_pixels, but in Sonic 2 they must be
(1)   67/   10972 :                     	; the same. $64 seems to be overkill, as $30 still results in good
(1)   68/   10972 :                     	; sprite culling.
