(1)   60/   13CDC :                     ; This macro declares data for an object. The data includes:
(1)   61/   13CDC :                     ; - the initial routine counter (byte)
(1)   62/   13CDC :                     ; - the initial mapping frame (byte)
(1)   63/   13CDC :                     ; - the width of the object (byte)
(1)   64/   13CDC :                     ; - the number of frames before it appears on screen (byte)
(1)   65/   13CDC :                     ; - the X position where it starts and where it will go back (word)
(1)   66/   13CDC :                     ; - the X position to reach (word)
(1)   67/   13CDC :                     ; - the Y position (word)
