(1)  389/   2DAEE :                     	; This code suggests that the intended effect is for each piece of
(1)  390/   2DAEE :                     	; the boss to explode before falling off. However, this does not work
(1)  391/   2DAEE :                     	; as the `x_pos` and `y_pos` values do not match the actual physical
(1)  392/   2DAEE :                     	; locations of the pieces. In fact, most pieces' X and Y positions are
(1)  393/   2DAEE :                     	; in the middle of the Eggmobile, completely ruining the effect.
(1)  394/   2DAEE :                     	; I would use `fixBugs` to fix this, but this is a pretty deep-rooted
(1)  395/   2DAEE :                     	; issue to would be complicated to fix.
