   21368/   367D4 :                     ; Subroutine to animate a sprite using an animation script
   21369/   367D4 :                     ; Works like AnimateSprite, except for:
   21370/   367D4 :                     ; * this function does not change render flags to match orientation given by
   21371/   367D4 :                     ;   the status byte;
   21372/   367D4 :                     ; * the function returns 0 on d0 if it changed the mapping frame, or 1 if an
   21373/   367D4 :                     ;   end-of-animation flag was found ($FC to $FF);
   21374/   367D4 :                     ; * it is only used by Mecha Sonic;
   21375/   367D4 :                     ; * some of the end-of-animation flags work differently.
   21376/   367D4 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   21377/   367D4 :                     
   21378/   367D4 :                     ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
