(1)    1/   E20E8 :                     ; Sonic the Hedgehog 2 disassembled Z80 sound driver
(1)    2/   E20E8 :                     
(1)    3/   E20E8 :                     ; Disassembled by Xenowhirl for AS
(1)    4/   E20E8 :                     ; Additional disassembly work by RAS Oct 2008
(1)    5/   E20E8 :                     ; RAS' work merged into SVN by Flamewing
