(1) 2796/     C61 :                     
(1) 2797/     C61 :                     	; Format of key on/off:
(1) 2798/     C61 :                     	; 4321 .ccc
(1) 2799/     C61 :                     	; Where 4321 are the bits for which operator,
(1) 2800/     C61 :                     	; and ccc is which channel (0-2 for channels 1-3, 4-6 for channels 4-6 WATCH BIT GAP)
(1) 2801/     C61 :                     
(1) 2802/     C61 : DF                  	rst	zWriteFMI	; Write to part I (note this particular register is ALWAYS sent to part I)
