(1) 3204/     DF1 :                     ; Bit 0-4 set which TL operators are actually effected for setting a volume;
(1) 3205/     DF1 :                     ; this table helps implement the following from the Sega Tech reference:
(1) 3206/     DF1 :                     ; "To make a note softer, only change the TL of the slots (the output operators).
(1) 3207/     DF1 :                     ; Changing the other operators will affect the flavor of the note."
(1) 3208/     DF1 :                     ; zloc_DF1
(1) 3209/     DF1 : (MACRO)              	ensure1byteoffset 8
